@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Sala de Espera (Lobby): Entrada Concurrente, Asignación de Color y Arranque de Partida

actor "Jugador 1 (Anfitrión)" as Host
actor "Jugador 2 (Invitado)" as Guest
participant "Lobby.tsx (Frontend)" as Client
participant "ColorHandler (Modal)" as ColorPicker
participant "PlayerRestController" as PlayerAPI
participant "SalmonMatchController" as SalmonAPI
participant "MatchRestController" as MatchAPI
participant "PlayerService" as PlayerService
participant "MatchService" as MatchService
participant "SimpMessagingTemplate" as StompBroker

== 1. Incorporación a Sala y Selección Exclusiva de Color ==

Guest -> Client: Accede al enlace de la sala /matches/:id/waiting
activate Client
Client -> Client: Detecta que usuario no tiene Player asignado
Client -> ColorPicker: Renderiza modal de selección de color
deactivate Client

Guest -> ColorPicker: Selecciona color libre (ej. "BLUE")
activate ColorPicker
ColorPicker -> PlayerAPI: POST /api/v1/players/match/{matchId}\n[Payload: CreatePlayerRequest { user: userId, color: BLUE }]
activate PlayerAPI

PlayerAPI -> PlayerService: createPlayerInMatch(matchId, request)
activate PlayerService

PlayerService -> PlayerService: Asignar color, energía (5), estado vivo y orden
PlayerService -> PlayerService: match.setPlayersNumber(playersNumber + 1)
PlayerService -> PlayerService: playerRepository.save(p)
PlayerService -> PlayerService: matchService.save(match)
PlayerService -> StompBroker: convertAndSend("/topic/match/newPlayer/" + matchId, lobbyPlayerDTO)
PlayerService -> StompBroker: convertAndSend("/topic/match/update/" + matchId, matchDTO)
PlayerService --> PlayerAPI: LobbyPlayerDTO
deactivate PlayerService

PlayerAPI --> ColorPicker: 201 Created [LobbyPlayerDTO]
deactivate PlayerAPI

ColorPicker -> SalmonAPI: POST /api/v1/salmonMatches/player/{createdPlayerId}
activate SalmonAPI
SalmonAPI -> SalmonAPI: Inicializar salmones del jugador en el mar
SalmonAPI --> ColorPicker: 201 Created
deactivate SalmonAPI

ColorPicker -> Client: onColorChanged() [Cierra modal]
deactivate ColorPicker

== 2. Sincronización en Tiempo Real de Participantes ==

StompBroker -> Client: Frame STOMP en /topic/match/newPlayer/{matchId}
Client -> Host: Actualiza lista visual de participantes (nuevo jugador con color)
Client -> Guest: Presenta sala de espera con su jugador configurado

== 3. Validación de Quórum y Arranque de Partida ==

note over Host, Client
  Quórum alcanzado: >= 2 jugadores sin colores duplicados.
end note

Host -> Client: Pulsa botón "Start Game"
Client -> MatchAPI: PATCH /api/v1/matches/{matchId}/startGame
activate MatchAPI

MatchAPI -> MatchService: startGame(matchId)
activate MatchService

MatchService -> MatchService: Establecer orden aleatorio de turnos (playerOrder)
MatchService -> MatchService: Asignar initialPlayer y actualPlayer
MatchService -> MatchService: Transición de Match a State.ON_GOING y Phase.TILES
MatchService -> StompBroker: convertAndSend("/topic/match/start/" + matchId, matchDTO)
deactivate MatchService

MatchAPI --> Client: 200 OK
deactivate MatchAPI

StompBroker -> Client: Frame STOMP en /topic/match/start/{matchId}
Client -> Host: Redirige automáticamente a /matches/:id/game
Client -> Guest: Redirige automáticamente a /matches/:id/game

@enduml
